      "narration": "Right minus equals one moves your friend one place to the left, so they put the eleven back and pick up nine. New total: one plus nine is ten. Still over budget, so nothing is solved yet. But look what that single step quietly bought us. Every pair involving the eleven-pound book has just gone, all five of them, and we never looked at one. We didn't need to: the shelf is sorted, so if eleven was too dear beside the cheapest book, it's too dear beside every book. That is the trick; the rest is bookkeeping.",
      "durationFrames": 943,
      "timingSource": "tts",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "data": {
